{"version":1,"content":"<p>周二（13日）天晴，早上最低氣溫約26°C，日間乾燥及炎熱，市區最高氣溫約32°C，新界再高一兩度，吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p>周三（14日）大致天晴及炎熱，稍後轉吹清勁東風及有一兩陣微雨。</p><p>隨後兩三日部分時間有陽光。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T13:59:06.816278+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:14:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T15:37:43.042037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:57:42.366711+00:00","content_hash":"109d6cac2f4b5e9aa43b6beabcfbdc4c804fcf0ece7bbcaa92d9877ba1ff641c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}